#. Key:	HUB_EXIT_DENY_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,HUB_EXIT_DENY_1"
msgid "HUB_EXIT_DENY_1"
msgstr "I should see everything before starting my shift..."

#. Key:	LEVEL_0_END_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_0_END_1"
msgid "LEVEL_0_END_1"
msgstr "Done and dusted."

#. Key:	LEVEL_0_END_10
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_0_END_10"
msgid "LEVEL_0_END_10"
msgstr "I think those days are still far Lord. You know my pride is set on keeping this place spotless from top to bottom."

#. Key:	LEVEL_0_END_11
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_0_END_11"
msgid "LEVEL_0_END_11"
msgstr "True that, true that… tho, I am sure even a maid of <b>your talents</> needs a breather from time to time, no?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_0_END_12
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_0_END_12"
msgid "LEVEL_0_END_12"
msgstr "When was the last time you went on a holiday? Five… six decades ago? How old are you anyways? Three, four hundred years old?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_0_END_13
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_0_END_13"
msgid "LEVEL_0_END_13"
msgstr "I don’t need a break. Doing my job is its own reward!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_0_END_14
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_0_END_14"
msgid "LEVEL_0_END_14"
msgstr "Hhmf… very well then, suit yourself. You paragon of cleanliness, you…"

#. Key:	LEVEL_0_END_15
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_0_END_15"
msgid "LEVEL_0_END_15"
msgstr "Astounding job, my dear Dorothy. You can go rest those tired arms of your now. <c>Toodles!!</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_0_END_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_0_END_2"
msgid "LEVEL_0_END_2"
msgstr "Excellent work! And not a minute too soon. Looks like Lord Kaios is coming, that's my cue to hide!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_0_END_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_0_END_3"
msgid "LEVEL_0_END_3"
msgstr "Ah, nothing beats the feeling of coming back to a clean home after a day of <b>PURE</> conquering!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_0_END_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_0_END_4"
msgid "LEVEL_0_END_4"
msgstr "I mean, just <c>look</> at this floor! So clean, so polished. Why, I can see my own reflection staring back at me… <c>Helloooooo</> handsome! Heh..."

#. Key:	LEVEL_0_END_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_0_END_5"
msgid "LEVEL_0_END_5"
msgstr "I see everything is in order, as per usual. No? Nothing unusual, nothing <b>too</> ghastly to deal with I imagine, hmmm?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_0_END_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_0_END_6"
msgid "LEVEL_0_END_6"
msgstr "Everything in order, everything clean and spotless Lord."

#. Key:	LEVEL_0_END_7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_0_END_7"
msgid "LEVEL_0_END_7"
msgstr "Fantastic! I know I can always count on you to get the job done, Dorothy. But alas! How will I manage when the day comes you choose to…"

#. Key:	LEVEL_0_END_8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_0_END_8"
msgid "LEVEL_0_END_8"
msgstr "<brc>R E T I R E…?</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_0_END_9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_0_END_9"
msgid "LEVEL_0_END_9"
msgstr "You know? Search for greener pastures? throw in the towel? hang your apron?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_END_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_END_1"
msgid "LEVEL_10_END_1"
msgstr "… So it was <b>you</> all along! All these years fighting and cleaning, dealing with those pests, and it was <b>YOU</> who let them in?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_END_10
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_END_10"
msgid "LEVEL_10_END_10"
msgstr "You passed! With flying colors! Squeaky clean and lemon-scented! Congratulations! Huzzah!! Pop the champagne, bring out the band and the confetti!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_END_11
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_END_11"
msgid "LEVEL_10_END_11"
msgstr "Hmph. I should’ve known. A practice run, of course! It never hurts to hone one’s craft."

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_END_12
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_END_12"
msgid "LEVEL_10_END_12"
msgstr "Thank you, Lord Kaios, that will keep me sharp. From this day forward I will redouble my efforts!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_END_13
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_END_13"
msgid "LEVEL_10_END_13"
msgstr "<wh>Oh no, please don’t…</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_END_14
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_END_14"
msgid "LEVEL_10_END_14"
msgstr "What was that?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_END_15
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_END_15"
msgid "LEVEL_10_END_15"
msgstr "I said: <b>“Marvelous! Simply marvelous!”</> Truly, you are unmatched!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_END_16
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_END_16"
msgid "LEVEL_10_END_16"
msgstr "So unmatched, in fact, that you deserve… a reward! How about… a <b>long</>, relaxing trip to some delightful tropical paradise? My treat!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_END_17
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_END_17"
msgid "LEVEL_10_END_17"
msgstr "Think about it! Sandy beaches, palm trees, a straw hat on your head, sunglasses on your face, sipping piña colada while watching the sunset. Wadda' ya say? I’ll help you pack!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_END_18
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_END_18"
msgid "LEVEL_10_END_18"
msgstr "I think I’ll pass on the trip, Lord. Filth takes no breaks, and I won’t either!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_END_19
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_END_19"
msgid "LEVEL_10_END_19"
msgstr "But... I could always use a raise."

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_END_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_END_2"
msgid "LEVEL_10_END_2"
msgstr "<b>You</> sent those creatures after me, filled the halls with filth, all just to… what? Get rid of me?!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_END_20
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_END_20"
msgid "LEVEL_10_END_20"
msgstr "Ahaha!! Oh-ho-HO! A raise! Of course! Absolutely!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_END_21
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_END_21"
msgid "LEVEL_10_END_21"
msgstr "A raise it is! <bgc>5%</> extra shall do it! Consider it… a token of my undying appreciation."

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_END_22
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_END_22"
msgid "LEVEL_10_END_22"
msgstr "Make it <bcc>70%</> extra."

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_END_23
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_END_23"
msgid "LEVEL_10_END_23"
msgstr "How about… <bgc>10%</>?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_END_24
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_END_24"
msgid "LEVEL_10_END_24"
msgstr "How about <bcc>80%</>."

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_END_25
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_END_25"
msgid "LEVEL_10_END_25"
msgstr "<b>HA!!</> Sure! Nothing says “loyal service rewarded” like an extra juicy paycheck!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_END_26
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_END_26"
msgid "LEVEL_10_END_26"
msgstr "<wh> or watching my gold reserves vanish into your pockets… but what can I do at this point…</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_END_27
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_END_27"
msgid "LEVEL_10_END_27"
msgstr "Thank you, Lord. It has been an honor and a privilege doing <bcc>my job</>."

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_END_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_END_3"
msgid "LEVEL_10_END_3"
msgstr "Oh-ho-HO, the <c>accusations</>! The betrayal in your voice! Before you do anything, let me explain!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_END_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_END_4"
msgid "LEVEL_10_END_4"
msgstr "Dorothy, sweet mop-wielding colossus, you <c>really</> think this was betrayal? Betrayal? Me? To get rid of <b>you</>? Perish the thought! This, all of <c>this</> was…"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_END_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_END_5"
msgid "LEVEL_10_END_5"
msgstr "Drumroll please..."

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_END_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_END_6"
msgid "LEVEL_10_END_6"
msgstr "<b>A test!</> Yes, a carefully crafted, top-secret, ultra-elite, certified <b>Maid Endurance Trial</>™!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_END_7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_END_7"
msgid "LEVEL_10_END_7"
msgstr "I had to know if you were still the best of the best, the cream of the crop, still sharp, still… uh… <b>clean-tastic</>."

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_END_8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_END_8"
msgid "LEVEL_10_END_8"
msgstr "It was all… A test of skill?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_END_9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_END_9"
msgid "LEVEL_10_END_9"
msgstr "Y-yep! Absolutely! A 100% genuine, <wh>definitely not made up just now</>, <b>LEGITIMATE</> test! And guess what?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_PREV_1_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_PREV_1_1"
msgid "LEVEL_10_PREV_1_1"
msgstr "Well, time to get going. We have a lot of work ahead of us today."

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_PREV_1_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_PREV_1_2"
msgid "LEVEL_10_PREV_1_2"
msgstr "Wait! Someone slid a note under the door while we slept..."

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_PREV_1_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_PREV_1_3"
msgid "LEVEL_10_PREV_1_3"
msgstr "Hm…? You’re right. Let's have a look…"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_PREV_2_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_PREV_2_1"
msgid "LEVEL_10_PREV_2_1"
msgstr "Uh… this is a joke, isn’t it?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_PREV_2_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_PREV_2_2"
msgid "LEVEL_10_PREV_2_2"
msgstr "Why do you say that?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_PREV_2_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_PREV_2_3"
msgid "LEVEL_10_PREV_2_3"
msgstr "Look at that letter! It looks like it was written by someone without thumbs! It sounds like a trap to me!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_PREV_2_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_PREV_2_4"
msgid "LEVEL_10_PREV_2_4"
msgstr "I recognize this calligraphy, this is Lord’s handwriting."

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_PREV_2_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_PREV_2_5"
msgid "LEVEL_10_PREV_2_5"
msgstr "He has been very cheery lately, with his conquest complete and whatnot… maybe this is a sign of good will?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_PREV_2_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_PREV_2_6"
msgid "LEVEL_10_PREV_2_6"
msgstr "Either way, I’ve been asking for a raise for a while now… I won’t turn away his generous gift over some baseless suspicions."

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_START_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_START_1"
msgid "LEVEL_10_START_1"
msgstr "Ahh, Dorothy! My spotless star, my iron-clad maiden, my beefcake housekeeper, my radiant mop in the darkness."

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_START_10
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_START_10"
msgid "LEVEL_10_START_10"
msgstr "For you have been betrayed… <b> by the Dark Lord</>!!!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_START_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_START_2"
msgid "LEVEL_10_START_2"
msgstr "You actually <b>fell</> for the note, didn’t you? Ha! <b>Priceless</>!!!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_START_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_START_3"
msgid "LEVEL_10_START_3"
msgstr "You see, this “raise” of yours? All but a devilish ruse by yours truly!!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_START_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_START_4"
msgid "LEVEL_10_START_4"
msgstr "<st>WHAT?!</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_START_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_START_5"
msgid "LEVEL_10_START_5"
msgstr "Called it! Called it, called it, <b>CALLED IT!</> Did I not say this was a trap?!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_START_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_START_6"
msgid "LEVEL_10_START_6"
msgstr "For decades, you’ve scrubbed, polished, scoured every inch of my halls while I was out taking over the world… and every time you made me look like a fool in <b>my own domain!</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_START_7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_START_7"
msgid "LEVEL_10_START_7"
msgstr "Well not today. Today is the day you fall! Today, every ounce of <bgc>grime</>, <bgc>dust</>, <bgc>muck</>, and <bgc>filth</> in this mansion rises against you!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_START_8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_START_8"
msgid "LEVEL_10_START_8"
msgstr "This is your end Dorothy. No more slow drips, no more sneaky tricks. Today I bury you under a tidal wave of your greatest <b>nightmare!</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_10_START_9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_10_START_9"
msgid "LEVEL_10_START_9"
msgstr "Now ready your pathetic cleaning tools and steel yourself!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_1_END_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_1_END_1"
msgid "LEVEL_1_END_1"
msgstr "Tally-ho! I’m back!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_1_END_10
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_1_END_10"
msgid "LEVEL_1_END_10"
msgstr "Ha ha ha…!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_1_END_11
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_1_END_11"
msgid "LEVEL_1_END_11"
msgstr "…"

#. Key:	LEVEL_1_END_12
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_1_END_12"
msgid "LEVEL_1_END_12"
msgstr "Oh, I jest, of course! Joking, joking! <wh>Please don’t kill me.</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_1_END_13
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_1_END_13"
msgid "LEVEL_1_END_13"
msgstr "I am <b>well</> aware of your capabilities, your strength… and your horrifying, unstoppable resolve…"

#. Key:	LEVEL_1_END_14
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_1_END_14"
msgid "LEVEL_1_END_14"
msgstr "Thank you, Lord. Do you need anything else done today?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_1_END_15
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_1_END_15"
msgid "LEVEL_1_END_15"
msgstr "No, no, no, no, no! You’ve done <b>quite</> enough. In fact, I’m fairly certain you’ve done <b>EVERYTHING</> that possibly could have been done today within these walls…"

#. Key:	LEVEL_1_END_16
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_1_END_16"
msgid "LEVEL_1_END_16"
msgstr "You are dismissed! Run along now! I have… <b>important matters</> to attend to. Plans to scheme, troops to command, speeches to write!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_1_END_17
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_1_END_17"
msgid "LEVEL_1_END_17"
msgstr "And evil laugh practice at 9:00, Lord."

#. Key:	LEVEL_1_END_18
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_1_END_18"
msgid "LEVEL_1_END_18"
msgstr "Yes… that too. <c>Toodles!!</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_1_END_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_1_END_2"
msgid "LEVEL_1_END_2"
msgstr "Ohhh dear <c>me</>. This place… it somehow looks even <b>better</> than it did yesterday! How do you <b>do</> it?! Witchcraft? Soapcraft? Both?!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_1_END_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_1_END_3"
msgid "LEVEL_1_END_3"
msgstr "Are you sure you aren’t magical, my dear Dorothy?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_1_END_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_1_END_4"
msgid "LEVEL_1_END_4"
msgstr "No Lord, no magics, no parlor tricks. Just soap, elbow grease, and pure grit."

#. Key:	LEVEL_1_END_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_1_END_5"
msgid "LEVEL_1_END_5"
msgstr "Oh right, you <b>did</> put that in your resume… Hmmmm…"

#. Key:	LEVEL_1_END_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_1_END_6"
msgid "LEVEL_1_END_6"
msgstr "Well, as per usual you’ve done a positively <b>absolutupendous</> job today."

#. Key:	LEVEL_1_END_7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_1_END_7"
msgid "LEVEL_1_END_7"
msgstr "It's a pleasure to hear that. I barely broke a sweat, Lord."

#. Key:	LEVEL_1_END_8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_1_END_8"
msgid "LEVEL_1_END_8"
msgstr "Oh me, oh my. Getting cocky? Careful there my dear Dorothy. You know what they say about pride! You fly high and then…"

#. Key:	LEVEL_1_END_9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_1_END_9"
msgid "LEVEL_1_END_9"
msgstr "<bst>SPLAT!</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_2_END_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_2_END_1"
msgid "LEVEL_2_END_1"
msgstr "Tally-ho, I’m back! Another day of <b>glorious glory</> for my three favorite people in the world: me, myself, and I! And. Would. You. Just. Look at this place!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_2_END_10
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_2_END_10"
msgid "LEVEL_2_END_10"
msgstr "What <c>is</> perfection, hmm? An endless battle against filth? Or a comfortable chair, a cold drink, and the acceptance of a few insignificant crumbs under the rug?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_2_END_11
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_2_END_11"
msgid "LEVEL_2_END_11"
msgstr "Crumbs under the rug are the start of chaos, Lord. And chaos is not welcome in this house."

#. Key:	LEVEL_2_END_12
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_2_END_12"
msgid "LEVEL_2_END_12"
msgstr "<wh>…of course she’d say that...</> Ha ha! Spoken like a true master of the broom! No quarter given, no mercy shown! You terrify me sometimes, Dorothy. In the most delightful way."

#. Key:	LEVEL_2_END_13
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_2_END_13"
msgid "LEVEL_2_END_13"
msgstr "..."

#. Key:	LEVEL_2_END_14
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_2_END_14"
msgid "LEVEL_2_END_14"
msgstr "Oh, don’t give me that stony stare. I'm kidding! It is all in good fun, isn't it? You’ve done marvelously once again. Run along now. Dismissed!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_2_END_15
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_2_END_15"
msgid "LEVEL_2_END_15"
msgstr "<c>Toodles!!</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_2_END_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_2_END_2"
msgid "LEVEL_2_END_2"
msgstr "Absolutely remarkable; sparkling floors, polished walls. I can run my fingers on the furniture and feel nothing but smooth, sparkling perfection! Like diamonds. <wh>Truly uncanny…</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_2_END_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_2_END_3"
msgid "LEVEL_2_END_3"
msgstr "<b>AHEM!</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_2_END_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_2_END_4"
msgid "LEVEL_2_END_4"
msgstr "All very nice, very clean and all that… Yadda yadda. Truly, Dorothy, you are a <b>gift</> wrapped up in an apron. You even come with a delightful bow. Heh heh heh…"

#. Key:	LEVEL_2_END_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_2_END_5"
msgid "LEVEL_2_END_5"
msgstr "I simply did what was expected, Lord. The mansion remains spotless."

#. Key:	LEVEL_2_END_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_2_END_6"
msgid "LEVEL_2_END_6"
msgstr "Spotless indeed… though I must say… <c>sniff sniff</> …the air feels a touch… heavier than usual."

#. Key:	LEVEL_2_END_7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_2_END_7"
msgid "LEVEL_2_END_7"
msgstr "Not dirty, mind you! But different. Like walking into a room where someone has been moving furniture around. Maddeningly subtle!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_2_END_8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_2_END_8"
msgid "LEVEL_2_END_8"
msgstr "If there was any imperfection, I would have already corrected it."

#. Key:	LEVEL_2_END_9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_2_END_9"
msgid "LEVEL_2_END_9"
msgstr "Oh, I don’t doubt it! Still, one can’t help but wonder…"

#. Key:	LEVEL_2_START_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_2_START_1"
msgid "LEVEL_2_START_1"
msgstr "Oh, hey Dorothy? I almost forgot to tell ya <bcc>something important</>. Took a quick stroll to one of our living rooms today and guess what I found on my way there..."

#. Key:	LEVEL_2_START_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_2_START_2"
msgid "LEVEL_2_START_2"
msgstr "We got <bgc>Dust Bunnies</> roaming around! Almost forgot how <c>precious</> they looked with those long, fluffy ears, the fluffy cotton ball tails! Makes you wanna just scoop ’em up and-"

#. Key:	LEVEL_2_START_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_2_START_3"
msgid "LEVEL_2_START_3"
msgstr "<b>Crush</> them for leaving dust everywhere? I was hoping they would've learned their lesson!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_2_START_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_2_START_4"
msgid "LEVEL_2_START_4"
msgstr "Not what I was going for!! Anyways in case you forgot: <bgc>Dust Bunnies</> are skittish little critters. They’ll scurry off if you get too close and spit <bgc>cotton balls</> at you from afar."

#. Key:	LEVEL_2_START_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_2_START_5"
msgid "LEVEL_2_START_5"
msgstr "Also, they don't care about <bcc>Washee & Flashee</>, they are too fluffy! While <bgc>Oozers</> don’t care about <bcc>Dusty</>, they are just too gooey!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_2_START_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_2_START_6"
msgid "LEVEL_2_START_6"
msgstr "<bgc>Each enemy has a resistance to the weapon of the opposite filth type</>. They still receive damage, just <b>very</> little! Just as you use each weapon to clean different stains-"

#. Key:	LEVEL_2_START_7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_2_START_7"
msgid "LEVEL_2_START_7"
msgstr "I must use different weapons to defeat my enemies."

#. Key:	LEVEL_2_START_8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_2_START_8"
msgid "LEVEL_2_START_8"
msgstr "Atta maid! Hope you like juggling and multitasking. 'Cause you'll be doing a lot of that from now on!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_END_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_END_1"
msgid "LEVEL_3_END_1"
msgstr "Tally-ho! I’m back! How’s my fav- <b>SNIFF SNIFF</>..."

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_END_10
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_END_10"
msgid "LEVEL_3_END_10"
msgstr "..."

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_END_11
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_END_11"
msgid "LEVEL_3_END_11"
msgstr "<b>AHEM</>… well anyways, moving on. Fantastic job. Truly remarkable as always. Clap clap clap and all that. You’re dismissed… <c>Toodles!!</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_END_12
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_END_12"
msgid "LEVEL_3_END_12"
msgstr "Is it just me, or wasn’t that just <c>suspicious</>? Awkward, but also very <b>VERY</> suspicious."

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_END_13
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_END_13"
msgid "LEVEL_3_END_13"
msgstr "I don’t know what you mean."

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_END_14
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_END_14"
msgid "LEVEL_3_END_14"
msgstr "He’s never cared about your choice of cleaning products before. <b>Suddenly</> he’s acting like the Tzar of fragrances? And on the <c>same</> day a <bgc>Grimelings</> pop up? That’s no coincidence!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_END_15
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_END_15"
msgid "LEVEL_3_END_15"
msgstr "Lord Kaios is probably just tired. His campaign is almost complete, he’s out all day dealing with champions, handling logistics…"

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_END_16
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_END_16"
msgid "LEVEL_3_END_16"
msgstr "Rehearsing evil speeches in his velvety, polka dot pajamas?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_END_17
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_END_17"
msgid "LEVEL_3_END_17"
msgstr "Whatever the case, I’m sure its just all that stress and excitement wearing him out."

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_END_18
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_END_18"
msgid "LEVEL_3_END_18"
msgstr "I’m not entirely convinced, but I’ll trust your judgement. Now how about we head back home and get some well-earned rest? I’m pooped…"

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_END_19
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_END_19"
msgid "LEVEL_3_END_19"
msgstr "How can you <b>POSSIBLY</> be tired? You just stood by and watched while I did <b>all</> the work."

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_END_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_END_2"
msgid "LEVEL_3_END_2"
msgstr "Hold on… is that… lavender? With a <c>dash</> of… what, hard-boiled eggs? Coleslaw salad? You bought some new detergent or something? Not sure I agree with the scent, too exotic for my taste."

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_END_20
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_END_20"
msgid "LEVEL_3_END_20"
msgstr "<c>Just</> stood by?! I was cheering you on from afar! That is <b>just</> as exhausting as all the stuff you do!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_END_21
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_END_21"
msgid "LEVEL_3_END_21"
msgstr "Let’s just go."

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_END_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_END_3"
msgid "LEVEL_3_END_3"
msgstr "Hm, nothing to be concerned about. It was but a minor bump on the road. But I handled it."

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_END_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_END_4"
msgid "LEVEL_3_END_4"
msgstr "A <c>minor</> bump? You’ve never been the “minor bump” type. You’re the type who leaves nothing behind but polished floors and dust-free cabinets. Unless, of course… you’re slowing down?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_END_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_END_5"
msgid "LEVEL_3_END_5"
msgstr "...!!!!!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_END_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_END_6"
msgid "LEVEL_3_END_6"
msgstr "<bst>KIDDING!</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_END_7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_END_7"
msgid "LEVEL_3_END_7"
msgstr "HA! Got you! Absolutely priceless! Ohhh, you should’ve seen your face! <wh>Terrifyingly unamused...</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_END_8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_END_8"
msgid "LEVEL_3_END_8"
msgstr "You know I jest, right? Just a touch of friendly banter, little jabs between friends. We <c>are</> friends, aren’t we? Or at least… good acquaintances?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_END_9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_END_9"
msgid "LEVEL_3_END_9"
msgstr "The kind that <b>don’t</>… say… <b>throttle</> each other with a mop handle?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_START_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_START_1"
msgid "LEVEL_3_START_1"
msgstr "What the…? Smell that? No way, you know what that means? We got <bgc>new foes</> today! Can you guess which?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_START_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_START_2"
msgid "LEVEL_3_START_2"
msgstr "That stench is unmistakable. Looks like the <bgc>Grimelings</> decided to show up today."

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_START_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_START_3"
msgid "LEVEL_3_START_3"
msgstr "That’s odd, those imps don’t tend to show themselves. I know we don’t see these critters much, so <bcc>here’s a refresher</>:"

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_START_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_START_4"
msgid "LEVEL_3_START_4"
msgstr "<bgc>Grimelings</> are all about stinking things up, literally! They’ll spray their revolting <bgc>gases</> on other <bgc>enemies</> and make ‘em much more aggressive!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_START_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_START_5"
msgid "LEVEL_3_START_5"
msgstr "And if you get caught in the cloud, your <bcc>SPECIAL ATTACK</> meter will be drained! I suggest you stay clear of those nasty fumes!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_START_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_START_6"
msgid "LEVEL_3_START_6"
msgstr "I’ll keep that in mind while I’m beating it into a paste."

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_START_7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_START_7"
msgid "LEVEL_3_START_7"
msgstr "Ha! That’s the Dorothy I love! Irrationally and comically <b>violent</>!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_3_START_8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_3_START_8"
msgid "LEVEL_3_START_8"
msgstr "Just… uh. Remember to mop that up after you’re done."

#. Key:	LEVEL_4_END_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_4_END_1"
msgid "LEVEL_4_END_1"
msgstr "Tally-ho! I’m back witches!!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_4_END_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_4_END_2"
msgid "LEVEL_4_END_2"
msgstr "Dorothy! My shining superstar of sanitation! Once again the halls sparkle like a diamond dipped in lemon-scented detergent. Truly performed to perfection! A round of applause!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_4_END_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_4_END_3"
msgid "LEVEL_4_END_3"
msgstr "Thank you, Lord, just doing my job."

#. Key:	LEVEL_4_END_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_4_END_4"
msgid "LEVEL_4_END_4"
msgstr "And doing it so well it brings a tear to my villainous eye. My humble <bcc>three million square feet</> mansion is cleaner all thanks to you!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_4_END_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_4_END_5"
msgid "LEVEL_4_END_5"
msgstr "Carry on, oh water-spraying, duster-swaying, mop-spinning, vacuum-wielding marvel!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_4_END_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_4_END_6"
msgid "LEVEL_4_END_6"
msgstr "Yes Lord Kaios. I aim to please."

#. Key:	LEVEL_4_START_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_4_START_1"
msgid "LEVEL_4_START_1"
msgstr "As I was saying yesterday... cheerleading is also hard work!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_4_START_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_4_START_2"
msgid "LEVEL_4_START_2"
msgstr "Then you wouldn’t mind switching places. Maybe I give you the weapons and I do the cheering?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_4_START_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_4_START_3"
msgid "LEVEL_4_START_3"
msgstr "And come out into the open where everyone can see me? <c>Nooooo</> thank you. Let's just call it even and say we are <b>BOTH</> just as useful every day, deal?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_4_START_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_4_START_4"
msgid "LEVEL_4_START_4"
msgstr "Heh… deal. Let's focus now. New day, new battle, no funny business."

#. Key:	LEVEL_4_START_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_4_START_5"
msgid "LEVEL_4_START_5"
msgstr "Not quite! Saw some purple <bgc>ooze</> leaking under one of our doors today. <bgc>Splitter Oozers</> must be back! Remember how they work?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_4_START_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_4_START_6"
msgid "LEVEL_4_START_6"
msgstr "Two little <bgc>oozelings</> clumped together to form a bigger, much meaner blob of sludge. A bit tougher, but if you hurt them enough they'll <bcc>split back up</>!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_4_START_7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_4_START_7"
msgid "LEVEL_4_START_7"
msgstr "How nice of them to clump together, saves me the trouble of hunting them down one by one!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_5_END_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_5_END_1"
msgid "LEVEL_5_END_1"
msgstr "Tally-ho! The <b>king</> of mansion inspections has arrived! The verdict is in: We got a floor so pristine it could make a lesser being <brc>burst into flames</>!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_5_END_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_5_END_2"
msgid "LEVEL_5_END_2"
msgstr "I only did what was necessary, Lord. Just another day of work."

#. Key:	LEVEL_5_END_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_5_END_3"
msgid "LEVEL_5_END_3"
msgstr "<b> Just another day of work</>!? My dear Dorothy, empires rise and fall with less spectacle than this marvelous display of sanitation!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_5_END_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_5_END_4"
msgid "LEVEL_5_END_4"
msgstr "You make it look so easy. I may start demanding extravagance every day!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_5_END_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_5_END_5"
msgid "LEVEL_5_END_5"
msgstr "You already do Lord."

#. Key:	LEVEL_5_END_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_5_END_6"
msgid "LEVEL_5_END_6"
msgstr "Do I really? Do I...? Of course, I do! <b>HA HA HA!</> And you deliver! A humble maid who outshines a thousand suns. A weaker despot might get jealous, but not me!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_5_END_7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_5_END_7"
msgid "LEVEL_5_END_7"
msgstr "I’ll keep it that way, Lord. Through mud and soot I shall prevail."

#. Key:	LEVEL_5_END_8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_5_END_8"
msgid "LEVEL_5_END_8"
msgstr "I knew you could handle it! Without a <b>shadow</> of a doubt! I'm off for today. Toodles!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_5_START_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_5_START_1"
msgid "LEVEL_5_START_1"
msgstr "Let’s do this. Time to get my hands dirty!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_5_START_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_5_START_2"
msgid "LEVEL_5_START_2"
msgstr "Get ready, set…"

#. Key:	LEVEL_5_START_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_5_START_3"
msgid "LEVEL_5_START_3"
msgstr "<bst>GO!!</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_6_END_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_6_END_1"
msgid "LEVEL_6_END_1"
msgstr "Tally-ho! What a day of glory and triumph for me! I should have my <b>unpaid</> and very recently <b>conquered</> servants erect a mighty statue in my honor!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_6_END_10
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_6_END_10"
msgid "LEVEL_6_END_10"
msgstr "Hmm? Did you say something Lord?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_6_END_11
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_6_END_11"
msgid "LEVEL_6_END_11"
msgstr "Ha! Ha! Nothing, nothing at all! Your hearing isn’t what it used to be I reckon! Or maybe you’re just sleepy!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_6_END_12
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_6_END_12"
msgid "LEVEL_6_END_12"
msgstr "Oh, golly yee! Would you look at the time? <b>YAWN</>. Its late, time to get some shut-eye myself!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_6_END_13
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_6_END_13"
msgid "LEVEL_6_END_13"
msgstr "<wh>Did he just say 'yawn' out loud?</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_6_END_14
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_6_END_14"
msgid "LEVEL_6_END_14"
msgstr "Splendid job, as always. You’ve kept my halls clean, my lungs clear, and my boots shining."

#. Key:	LEVEL_6_END_15
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_6_END_15"
msgid "LEVEL_6_END_15"
msgstr "You’ve earned some rest. You’re dismissed for the day. I'm off. Toodles!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_6_END_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_6_END_2"
msgid "LEVEL_6_END_2"
msgstr "I see your day was also fruitful, with the mansion being spotless as always and all that jazz."

#. Key:	LEVEL_6_END_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_6_END_3"
msgid "LEVEL_6_END_3"
msgstr "Just another day of honest hard work Lord."

#. Key:	LEVEL_6_END_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_6_END_4"
msgid "LEVEL_6_END_4"
msgstr "Marvelous! Simply marvelous. Though I must say… this place smells faintly of chimney smoke. Very… rustic."

#. Key:	LEVEL_6_END_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_6_END_5"
msgid "LEVEL_6_END_5"
msgstr "I almost feel as though I should slip into my favorite <b>baby seal fur robe</>, don my bunny slippers, and sip mulled wine by a hearth!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_6_END_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_6_END_6"
msgid "LEVEL_6_END_6"
msgstr "Truly, what more could an awesome and handsome conquering overlord ask for?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_6_END_7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_6_END_7"
msgid "LEVEL_6_END_7"
msgstr "What would <b>you</> ask for, Dorothy? My dear housemaid, my most loyal housekeeper? Perhaps a <b>long</> break? Vacations to a far, faaaaaaaar away land? Both?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_6_END_8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_6_END_8"
msgid "LEVEL_6_END_8"
msgstr "Nothing comes to mind Lord. Maybe greater challenges to stay sharp."

#. Key:	LEVEL_6_END_9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_6_END_9"
msgid "LEVEL_6_END_9"
msgstr "<wh>If those fools could even manage THAT we wouldn’t be having this conversation…</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_6_START_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_6_START_1"
msgid "LEVEL_6_START_1"
msgstr "Alright, here go! New day means the start of a new <b>mess-acre!</>. Heh, you liked what I did there?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_6_START_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_6_START_2"
msgid "LEVEL_6_START_2"
msgstr "<c>Mess-acre?</> Like a massacre but with mess? <b>MESS-ACRE</>?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_6_START_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_6_START_3"
msgid "LEVEL_6_START_3"
msgstr "<wh>My humor is wasted here</>."

#. Key:	LEVEL_6_START_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_6_START_4"
msgid "LEVEL_6_START_4"
msgstr "That was a little forced don’t you think?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_6_START_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_6_START_5"
msgid "LEVEL_6_START_5"
msgstr "Hey you are the cleaning expert not a comedian! Anyways, is it me, or does it smell like a forest fire today? <bgc>You know what that means...</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_6_START_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_6_START_6"
msgid "LEVEL_6_START_6"
msgstr "We may be facing <bgc>Ash Bunnies</> today! Those little soot-balls are even more skittish than their fluffier, less crispy <bgc>cousins</>."

#. Key:	LEVEL_6_START_7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_6_START_7"
msgid "LEVEL_6_START_7"
msgstr "They'll hide in their <bgc>dust mounds</> to avoid you! While hidden you can't attack them, but they can attack you!! You must <bcc>clean</> the mound first before beating them to a pulp."

#. Key:	LEVEL_6_START_8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_6_START_8"
msgid "LEVEL_6_START_8"
msgstr "I don’t care what they do, they are just another pest to squash. They can hide, they can run, but they won't escape!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_7_END_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_7_END_1"
msgid "LEVEL_7_END_1"
msgstr "Well, well, well… another day passes, and the mighty Dorothy still stands. Such a resilient little maid…"

#. Key:	LEVEL_7_END_10
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_7_END_10"
msgid "LEVEL_7_END_10"
msgstr "Ugh… Look… Shiny floors mean Dorothy is winning. And Dorothy winning… well, we can’t have <c>that</>, now, can we?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_7_END_11
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_7_END_11"
msgid "LEVEL_7_END_11"
msgstr "N-No Lord! Definitely not! Terrible thing! Forget we say anything! We’ll… We’ll ramp it up tomorrow! Extra stinky! More filth monsters!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_7_END_12
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_7_END_12"
msgid "LEVEL_7_END_12"
msgstr "Maybe a magic cauldron that spits out many, many <bgc>Oozers</>, or chimney that releases <bgc>Dust Bunnies</>! Or maybe we make <bgc>BIG MONSTER</> that crushes all!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_7_END_13
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_7_END_13"
msgid "LEVEL_7_END_13"
msgstr "Yes yes! Flood the mansion with <bgc>shi-</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_7_END_14
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_7_END_14"
msgid "LEVEL_7_END_14"
msgstr "<brc>NO NO NO NO NO NO!!!!</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_7_END_15
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_7_END_15"
msgid "LEVEL_7_END_15"
msgstr "No big monsters and no crazy spells!! I still want a place to <b>LIVE</> after this is all over!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_7_END_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_7_END_2"
msgid "LEVEL_7_END_2"
msgstr "You think yourself so powerful, oh sooooo strong with your mop, and your big, beefy arms…"

#. Key:	LEVEL_7_END_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_7_END_3"
msgid "LEVEL_7_END_3"
msgstr "Tell me, my little grimy confidants… are you <c>sure</> you’re doing what I asked of you?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_7_END_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_7_END_4"
msgid "LEVEL_7_END_4"
msgstr "Eh-heh, o-of course, boss! We spread the gunk, sprinkle the dust, puff the stink! Messy messy, dirty dirty! Just like you asked!!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_7_END_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_7_END_5"
msgid "LEVEL_7_END_5"
msgstr "And yet… the halls are cleaner than ever. Sparkling, even. I could almost see my reflection in the curtains..."

#. Key:	LEVEL_7_END_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_7_END_6"
msgid "LEVEL_7_END_6"
msgstr "<c>My reflection</>... <b>IN THE CURTAINS!!!!!!!</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_7_END_7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_7_END_7"
msgid "LEVEL_7_END_7"
msgstr "Some days I can’t even tell if you were here or not…"

#. Key:	LEVEL_7_END_8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_7_END_8"
msgid "LEVEL_7_END_8"
msgstr "B-But boss, don’t you like it…  <gcc>bleh</> … clean? You want clean, clean is good for you, right boss?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_7_END_9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_7_END_9"
msgid "LEVEL_7_END_9"
msgstr "<brc>NO!</> Not good! Not good at all! How many times do I have t-"

#. Key:	LEVEL_7_START_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_7_START_1"
msgid "LEVEL_7_START_1"
msgstr "Another day, another mess. Let’s make this quick."

#. Key:	LEVEL_7_START_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_7_START_2"
msgid "LEVEL_7_START_2"
msgstr "Quick? Oh, don’t say that!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_7_START_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_7_START_3"
msgid "LEVEL_7_START_3"
msgstr "Every time someone says “quick,” the universe hears it and tosses in <c>extra filth</> just to spite us."

#. Key:	LEVEL_7_START_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_7_START_4"
msgid "LEVEL_7_START_4"
msgstr "A little challenge never hurt anyone. So I’ll say it again: quick."

#. Key:	LEVEL_7_START_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_7_START_5"
msgid "LEVEL_7_START_5"
msgstr "… Oh, no. You’ve doomed us all!!!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_END_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_END_1"
msgid "LEVEL_8_END_1"
msgstr "Alright, alright, I’ve just about <c>had it</>!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_END_10
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_END_10"
msgid "LEVEL_8_END_10"
msgstr "And the apron, boss, <b>THE APRON</>!! It’s spotless! <c>Spotless</>! That’s unnatural, boss! She’s a cleaning demon!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_END_11
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_END_11"
msgid "LEVEL_8_END_11"
msgstr "You sad, pathetic, insignificant, unclean joke of a flatulent menagerie!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_END_12
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_END_12"
msgid "LEVEL_8_END_12"
msgstr "I <c>know</> she’s terrifying! You think I haven’t noticed? She could wrap her hands around my neck and wring me out like a sponge if she wanted!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_END_13
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_END_13"
msgid "LEVEL_8_END_13"
msgstr "This was supposed to be simple! So simple it was masterful!! You mess the place, I come back and go <c>“Ho ho ho! this place sucks!”</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_END_14
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_END_14"
msgid "LEVEL_8_END_14"
msgstr "She gets frustrated, maybe quits, maybe retires to a distant, far off land forever!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_END_15
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_END_15"
msgid "LEVEL_8_END_15"
msgstr "And finally I get peace! Quiet! My halls, my throne, MY RULE! <c>Without</> her shadow looming over me!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_END_16
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_END_16"
msgid "LEVEL_8_END_16"
msgstr "Uh… peace and quiet… with us?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_END_17
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_END_17"
msgid "LEVEL_8_END_17"
msgstr "With y-"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_END_18
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_END_18"
msgid "LEVEL_8_END_18"
msgstr "<srb>NO!</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_END_19
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_END_19"
msgid "LEVEL_8_END_19"
msgstr "Not with <c>you</>! Just <c>me, myself and I</>!! Alone! Master of my domain, lord of the world, king of <b>ALL</>!! Without her spotless mug mocking my very existence!!!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_END_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_END_2"
msgid "LEVEL_8_END_2"
msgstr "It's been a week since I told you lot to double your efforts! <b>SEVEN. WHOLE. DAYS.!!!</> Not to mention the <b>WAAAAAAY</> over sixty years I’ve had you clowns on a payroll!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_END_20
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_END_20"
msgid "LEVEL_8_END_20"
msgstr "Listen up, and listen good my grimy little disappointments: <c>Dorothy cannot keep winning.</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_END_21
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_END_21"
msgid "LEVEL_8_END_21"
msgstr "If she does, then… then what am I, huh? Lord Kaios, Conqueror of All Realms…? or Lord Kaios, <b>janitor’s landlord?!</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_END_22
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_END_22"
msgid "LEVEL_8_END_22"
msgstr "No no no boss! You are boss! You are always still boss! We’ll fix it, Lord Kaios, We swear!! More grime, more crime! Extra stink! Double the dust! Triple the muck!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_END_23
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_END_23"
msgid "LEVEL_8_END_23"
msgstr "You’d better. Because if you fail me again… I swear on my momma Kaios…"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_END_24
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_END_24"
msgid "LEVEL_8_END_24"
msgstr "That I’ll shove you lot in a laundry basket, wrap you in blankets and drop you in with the whites. <b>Hot</> cycle. <b>NO</> fabric softener!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_END_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_END_3"
msgid "LEVEL_8_END_3"
msgstr "And what do I see day after day, after day, after stinking day?! Dorothy, <b>my</> Dorothy, <bcc> THAT DOROTHY</>, waltzing through the halls like she owns the place! Strutting by like some…"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_END_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_END_4"
msgid "LEVEL_8_END_4"
msgstr "Some… some kind of… bleach-soaked beefcake of a juggernaut!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_END_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_END_5"
msgid "LEVEL_8_END_5"
msgstr "Eh-heh… w-we tried, boss! The ooze, the dust, the-"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_END_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_END_6"
msgid "LEVEL_8_END_6"
msgstr "Tried?! No no no no no. There is no <c>try</>!!! You either <b>do</>, or screw up spectacularly!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_END_7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_END_7"
msgid "LEVEL_8_END_7"
msgstr "<brc>AND YOU’RE SCREWING UP SPECTACULARLY!!!</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_END_8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_END_8"
msgid "LEVEL_8_END_8"
msgstr "I want you to <b>DELIVER</>!!!!!!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_END_9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_END_9"
msgid "LEVEL_8_END_9"
msgstr "But she’s scary! Her eyes, all fiery and stabby like a dragon’s, her mop is like a hammer! The detergent blinds us! The vacuum deafens us!!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_START_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_START_1"
msgid "LEVEL_8_START_1"
msgstr "Ah, rise and shine, Dorothy! Another glorious morning! The dust sparkles, the muck glistens, the smell… eugh…"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_START_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_START_2"
msgid "LEVEL_8_START_2"
msgstr "The smell is… we can work on the smell."

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_START_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_START_3"
msgid "LEVEL_8_START_3"
msgstr "If by “glorious” you mean “it’ll be easy peasy” then yes. Absolutely radiant."

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_START_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_START_4"
msgid "LEVEL_8_START_4"
msgstr "That’s the spirit! Keep that cheery attitude, and we’ll be done in a flash! Maybe you clean soo good today our enemies pack their things and leave for good!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_START_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_START_5"
msgid "LEVEL_8_START_5"
msgstr "If only. Would save me a lot of mopping."

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_START_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_START_6"
msgid "LEVEL_8_START_6"
msgstr "True, true. But then <c>I’d</> be bored out of my mind… and as I always say: a bored Gorch is a sad Gorch."

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_START_7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_START_7"
msgid "LEVEL_8_START_7"
msgstr "So why don’t we keep this nice and entertaining?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_8_START_8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_8_START_8"
msgid "LEVEL_8_START_8"
msgstr "With how much you enjoy violence? I can deliver, with a pink bow on top."

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_END_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_END_1"
msgid "LEVEL_9_END_1"
msgstr "Tally-ho! I’m back!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_END_10
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_END_10"
msgid "LEVEL_9_END_10"
msgstr "And you still can’t make a dent in her flawless, unstoppable cleaning regime after all these years?!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_END_11
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_END_11"
msgid "LEVEL_9_END_11"
msgstr "We’re trying, boss! But she’s… she’s unstoppable!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_END_12
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_END_12"
msgid "LEVEL_9_END_12"
msgstr "Unstoppable?! Oh, of course! Unstoppable! Why didn’t I think of that? Must’ve slipped my mind! How smart of you, real smooth Gregory! <c>Bravo</>!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_END_13
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_END_13"
msgid "LEVEL_9_END_13"
msgstr "There must be a weakness! Some flaw! Some teeny, tiny crack you fetid imps can smear mud into!!!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_END_14
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_END_14"
msgid "LEVEL_9_END_14"
msgstr "Any suggestions? Anyone? Yes, you! In the back!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_END_15
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_END_15"
msgid "LEVEL_9_END_15"
msgstr "Maybe… you can help us Lord?"

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_END_16
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_END_16"
msgid "LEVEL_9_END_16"
msgstr "…"

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_END_17
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_END_17"
msgid "LEVEL_9_END_17"
msgstr "<syb>ZAAAAAAAAAP!!</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_END_18
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_END_18"
msgid "LEVEL_9_END_18"
msgstr "Anyone else got any other bright ideas?!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_END_19
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_END_19"
msgid "LEVEL_9_END_19"
msgstr "W-we’ll give it everything we’ve got, boss! For real this time! Attack more rooms, unleash all the monsters! She can’t be everywhere at once, she will fail!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_END_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_END_2"
msgid "LEVEL_9_END_2"
msgstr "Ah, Dorothy! Marvelous work today, as always. Spotless floors, gleaming surfaces… not a single streak out of place. Truly… exemplary."

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_END_20
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_END_20"
msgid "LEVEL_9_END_20"
msgstr "Don’t hold back. I want filth! Confusion! Sabotage! Every dirty, little trick you’ve been saving under those pitiful masks!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_END_21
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_END_21"
msgid "LEVEL_9_END_21"
msgstr "And if you fail… oh, my dear little imps, each one of you will get <brc>ten thousand years</> in the dungeons… and that’s <c>just</> for starters!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_END_22
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_END_22"
msgid "LEVEL_9_END_22"
msgstr "<b>YES SIR LORD KAIOS!!! WE WON’T DISAPPOINT YOU, SIR!!</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_END_23
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_END_23"
msgid "LEVEL_9_END_23"
msgstr "This is it, the final stretch… Let’s see if that pathetic, puny maid can survive the <b>full, unrelenting might</> of my grimy little army! She will be defeated, she will vanish…"

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_END_24
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_END_24"
msgid "LEVEL_9_END_24"
msgstr "<b>AND EVERY CORNER OF THE WORLD WILL BE ALL MINE!!</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_END_25
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_END_25"
msgid "LEVEL_9_END_25"
msgstr "<st>AHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA!!!!!!!</>"

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_END_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_END_3"
msgid "LEVEL_9_END_3"
msgstr "Thank you, Lord. Just doing my job."

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_END_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_END_4"
msgid "LEVEL_9_END_4"
msgstr "Indeed, and what a job it is! I feel like a broken record congratulating you this much, but if I say nothing, I get an <c>itch!</> I rely on you to keep this mansion impeccable. Your diligence… it’s inspiring, really."

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_END_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_END_5"
msgid "LEVEL_9_END_5"
msgstr "I appreciate that, Lord. I’ll be ready for tomorrow as well."

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_END_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_END_6"
msgid "LEVEL_9_END_6"
msgstr "Excellent. Go rest now, Dorothy. Tomorrow will be another glorious day, showered by your unparalleled excellence! Everything is fine."

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_END_7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_END_7"
msgid "LEVEL_9_END_7"
msgstr "………..………..………..………..……….."

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_END_8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_END_8"
msgid "LEVEL_9_END_8"
msgstr "Everything is <b>not</> fine! Now… you lot. Look at me! Really look! I haven’t slept in days. I have bags under my eyes… and those bags have <b>BAGS</>!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_END_9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_END_9"
msgid "LEVEL_9_END_9"
msgstr "I’ve had it with your excuses. Pathetic, bumbling, rotten little <brc>failures</>! I’ve given you more time than I’ve given any minions… more opportunities than I can count…"

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_START_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_START_1"
msgid "LEVEL_9_START_1"
msgstr "Morning, Dorothy! Another day, another… well… you know."

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_START_10
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_START_10"
msgid "LEVEL_9_START_10"
msgstr "Right… of course. Just… keep your mop ready, Dorothy. I can’t shake the feeling something strange is going on…"

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_START_11
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_START_11"
msgid "LEVEL_9_START_11"
msgstr "Relax, everything will be fine as always, you’ll see."

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_START_12
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_START_12"
msgid "LEVEL_9_START_12"
msgstr "Now, let’s get to work."

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_START_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_START_2"
msgid "LEVEL_9_START_2"
msgstr "Another day, indeed. Are you alright? You look like you just smelled something foul."

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_START_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_START_3"
msgid "LEVEL_9_START_3"
msgstr "Uh… maybe I did. Or maybe it’s just that things feel… off, today."

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_START_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_START_4"
msgid "LEVEL_9_START_4"
msgstr "Is it just me, or this past week has been rather hectic? More than usual I mean… After years of repetition, we all of a sudden have new enemies about…"

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_START_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_START_5"
msgid "LEVEL_9_START_5"
msgstr "Hmm. I highly doubt it. New enemies?  Yes. Harder challenges? A little. Truly invigorating."

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_START_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_START_6"
msgid "LEVEL_9_START_6"
msgstr "But I haven’t felt close to defeat, not even once! It’s probably just your imagination."

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_START_7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_START_7"
msgid "LEVEL_9_START_7"
msgstr "No, no, really. Even Lord Kaios hasn’t been poking around like usual. Haven’t seen him at all today!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_START_8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_START_8"
msgid "LEVEL_9_START_8"
msgstr "Didn’t take the lunch you packed for him, and his coffee mug was cold this morning!"

#. Key:	LEVEL_9_START_9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,LEVEL_9_START_9"
msgid "LEVEL_9_START_9"
msgstr "He’s probably busy. Conquering plans, world domination… the usual. I wouldn’t worry."

#. Key:	TOUR_HUB_01_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TOUR_HUB_01_1"
msgid "TOUR_HUB_01_1"
msgstr "Wakey Wakey! We got a long day of killing and cleaning ahead of us! Hope you're ready for action!"

#. Key:	TOUR_HUB_01_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TOUR_HUB_01_2"
msgid "TOUR_HUB_01_2"
msgstr "Yes, got a good night’s rest and I’m ready to get my hands dirty."

#. Key:	TOUR_HUB_01_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TOUR_HUB_01_3"
msgid "TOUR_HUB_01_3"
msgstr "We got some time to spare before our day starts, so you can relax here in <bcc>your bedroom</> for as long as you want. Want some coffee? Croissants?"

#. Key:	TOUR_HUB_02_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TOUR_HUB_02_1"
msgid "TOUR_HUB_02_1"
msgstr "Planning on giving the <bcc>dummy</> a good scrub or a good beating?"

#. Key:	TOUR_HUB_02_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TOUR_HUB_02_2"
msgid "TOUR_HUB_02_2"
msgstr "Both actually. Multitasking is a very useful skill. Years of experience are good and all, but I cannot allow myself to grow rusty."

#. Key:	TOUR_HUB_02_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TOUR_HUB_02_3"
msgid "TOUR_HUB_02_3"
msgstr "We wouldn't want that! Still, multitasking is good for another reason: <bcc>SPECIAL ATTACKS</>!"

#. Key:	TOUR_HUB_02_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TOUR_HUB_02_4"
msgid "TOUR_HUB_02_4"
msgstr "<bcc>SPECIAL ATTACKS</> are powerful abilities that will clean and damage enemies. You can fill your <bcc>SPECIAL BAR</> by cleaning and fighting. Once it is full it'll light up in righteous flames!"

#. Key:	TOUR_HUB_02_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TOUR_HUB_02_5"
msgid "TOUR_HUB_02_5"
msgstr "Then by pressing the <b>LB</> on your controller or <b>Middle Mouse Button</> you unleash their full power. This will empty the bar, so use them wisely!!"

#. Key:	TOUR_HUB_02_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TOUR_HUB_02_6"
msgid "TOUR_HUB_02_6"
msgstr "Use the <b>LB</> on your controller or <b>Middle Mouse</> to unleash your special attack. This will empty the bar, so use them wisely!"

#. Key:	TOUR_HUB_03_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TOUR_HUB_03_1"
msgid "TOUR_HUB_03_1"
msgstr "So, today we go back into our usual flow, the race against time and all that. Hope the extra mileage doesn’t strain your knees!"

#. Key:	TOUR_HUB_03_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TOUR_HUB_03_2"
msgid "TOUR_HUB_03_2"
msgstr "Don’t be rude. There's no hurdle I can't surpass, no challenge I can't overcome."

#. Key:	TOUR_HUB_03_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TOUR_HUB_03_3"
msgid "TOUR_HUB_03_3"
msgstr "True that. Either way we're on a very tight schedule! You must defeat every <bgc>enemy</> and <bcc>clean </> every room before the clock runs out."

#. Key:	TOUR_HUB_03_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TOUR_HUB_03_4"
msgid "TOUR_HUB_03_4"
msgstr "Otherwise, the mansion will be a mess when Lord Kaios returns, and if that happens <brc>you can kiss your job goodbye</>! Lucky we got one handy perk up our sleeve: <b>every time you clean a room you'll get a nice pocketful of extra time</>!"

#. Key:	TOUR_HUB_03_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TOUR_HUB_03_5"
msgid "TOUR_HUB_03_5"
msgstr "Still, none of this is an excuse to slack on the field! As I always say: <b>When pride leads the way, you waste half the day!</>"

#. Key:	TOUR_HUB_03_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TOUR_HUB_03_6"
msgid "TOUR_HUB_03_6"
msgstr "That won’t happen, I’ve been doing this for years. Haven’t failed yet, and I won’t fail now!"

#. Key:	TOUR_HUB_04_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TOUR_HUB_04_1"
msgid "TOUR_HUB_04_1"
msgstr "This <bcc>door</> goes back to the mansion. I won’t leave <bcc>unless I am ready to start my shift</>. Lord Kaios doesn’t pay me more for doing extra time…"

#. Key:	TOUR_HUB_04_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TOUR_HUB_04_2"
msgid "TOUR_HUB_04_2"
msgstr "You are talking out loud. To a door… You’re talking to a <b>door</>. You know it can’t respond, right?"

#. Key:	TOUR_HUB_04_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TOUR_HUB_04_3"
msgid "TOUR_HUB_04_3"
msgstr "Be quiet."

#. Key:	TUT_0_R1_MOVAIM_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R1_MOVAIM_2"
msgid "TUT_0_R1_MOVAIM_2"
msgstr "It smells like mold... mold and grime… With a faint hint of <b>fear</>."

#. Key:	TUT_0_R1_MOVAIM_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R1_MOVAIM_3"
msgid "TUT_0_R1_MOVAIM_3"
msgstr "Don’t you get paid to clean all that up anyways? So my point stands! Speaking of standing, which you’re currently doing a terrific job at, might I add..."

#. Key:	TUT_0_R1_MOVAIM_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R1_MOVAIM_4"
msgid "TUT_0_R1_MOVAIM_4"
msgstr "Like an angry coat rack, or a grumpy lamp… Any sight of our unwanted little <bgc>guests</>?"

#. Key:	TUT_0_R1_MOVAIM_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R1_MOVAIM_5"
msgid "TUT_0_R1_MOVAIM_5"
msgstr "No… They are gone. Just like my patience."

#. Key:	TUT_0_R1_MOVAIM_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R1_MOVAIM_6"
msgid "TUT_0_R1_MOVAIM_6"
msgstr "Tell me <bcc>Gorch</>, are you sure you actually saw them come this way, or did they sneak off to the cellar?"

#. Key:	TUT_0_R1_MOVAIM_7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R1_MOVAIM_7"
msgid "TUT_0_R1_MOVAIM_7"
msgstr "Oh. <b>Absolutely and positively</>!!  Almost entirely! <c>Fifty — fifty</>… <wh>give or take fifty</>."

#. Key:	TUT_0_R1_MOVAIM_8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R1_MOVAIM_8"
msgid "TUT_0_R1_MOVAIM_8"
msgstr "Still, lets keep looking <c>juuuuuuuust</> in case!"

#. Key:	TUT_0_R2_CLEAN_1_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R2_CLEAN_1_1"
msgid "TUT_0_R2_CLEAN_1_1"
msgstr "Aha! There’s our first clue: Puddles of <bgc>ooze</>! You got <bcc>Washee & Flashee</> with you, right?"

#. Key:	TUT_0_R2_CLEAN_1_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R2_CLEAN_1_2"
msgid "TUT_0_R2_CLEAN_1_2"
msgstr "Hm? Yes I do, wh-"

#. Key:	TUT_0_R2_CLEAN_1_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R2_CLEAN_1_3"
msgid "TUT_0_R2_CLEAN_1_3"
msgstr "Hm? Yes I do, wh-"

#. Key:	TUT_0_R2_CLEAN_2_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R2_CLEAN_2_1"
msgid "TUT_0_R2_CLEAN_2_1"
msgstr "Oh, you got 'em, good! Now… Aim at the <bgc>ooze</> and press <b>LT</> on your controller or <b>Right Mouse Button</> to clean it up!"

#. Key:	TUT_0_R2_CLEAN_2_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R2_CLEAN_2_2"
msgid "TUT_0_R2_CLEAN_2_2"
msgstr "What? Buttons?… Who are you talking to?"

#. Key:	TUT_0_R2_CLEAN_2_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R2_CLEAN_2_3"
msgid "TUT_0_R2_CLEAN_2_3"
msgstr "Just speaking out loud! Anyway lets get to it. We better clean that up before we keep going... or not, I'm a tutorial, not a cop."

#. Key:	TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_1_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_1_1"
msgid "TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_1_1"
msgstr "They didn’t stand a chance! Didn't doubt it at all, not even for a moment! But look at you, you are <bgc>FILTHY</>! You can’t go on cleaning like that!"

#. Key:	TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_1_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_1_2"
msgid "TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_1_2"
msgstr "Let's find a <bcc>Clean-o-Matic</> and get you a sparkling new suit shall we?"

#. Key:	TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_1_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_1_3"
msgid "TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_1_3"
msgstr "Alright, where’s the nearest one?"

#. Key:	TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_1_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_1_4"
msgid "TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_1_4"
msgstr "Good segway for our next useful little tool: Your <bcc>minimap</>! The minimap is useful to know where you are, as well as the <bcc>condition of the rooms you visit</>, so listen closely:"

#. Key:	TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_1_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_1_5"
msgid "TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_1_5"
msgstr "If the room has <bgc>GREEN SPOTS</> then there are <bgc>enemies</> and <bgc>filth</> still lurking in it. Meaning you have to clean it up."

#. Key:	TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_2_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_2_1"
msgid "TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_2_1"
msgstr "The <bcc>Minimap</> is useful to know where you are, as well as the condition of the rooms you visit, so listen closely:"

#. Key:	TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_2_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_2_2"
msgid "TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_2_2"
msgstr "If the room has <bgc>GREEN SPOTS</> it means there are <bgc>enemies</> and <bgc>filth</> still lurking in it. Meaning you have to clean it up!"

#. Key:	TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_2_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_2_3"
msgid "TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_2_3"
msgstr "Once you <bcc>clean the room and deal with all the enemies</> inside, the room will turn <bcc>BLUE</>. That’s how you know your work in them is done!"

#. Key:	TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_2_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_2_4"
msgid "TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_2_4"
msgstr "Rooms with <bcc>Clean-o-Matics</> are marked with <bcc>BUBBLES</> on the mini map. Keep an eye on those!"

#. Key:	TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_2_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_2_5"
msgid "TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_2_5"
msgstr "Wait, minimap? what are you talking abou-"

#. Key:	TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_2_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_2_6"
msgid "TUT_0_R2_MINIMAP_2_6"
msgstr "No time to explain, look at your minimap to find the nearest <bcc>Clean-o-Matic</>! Lets gooooooooooooo!!!"

#. Key:	TUT_0_R3_COMBAT_1_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R3_COMBAT_1_1"
msgid "TUT_0_R3_COMBAT_1_1"
msgstr "There they are! <bgc>Oozers</>! This room is a mess, and as long as there is <bgc>filth and enemies</> it won’t be in acceptable conditions! We must deal with <b>both</> before moving on."

#. Key:	TUT_0_R3_COMBAT_1_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R3_COMBAT_1_2"
msgid "TUT_0_R3_COMBAT_1_2"
msgstr "Aim at the <bgc>Oozers</> and press  <b>RT</> on your controller or <b>Left Mouse Button</> to <bcc>attack with Washee and Flashee</>."

#. Key:	TUT_0_R3_COMBAT_1_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R3_COMBAT_1_3"
msgid "TUT_0_R3_COMBAT_1_3"
msgstr "Our enemies are <b>too weak to actually hurt you</>, their attacks get you <bgc>FILTHY</> instead! Keep an eye on your <bcc>HP</>. Your Hygiene Points."

#. Key:	TUT_0_R3_COMBAT_1_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R3_COMBAT_1_4"
msgid "TUT_0_R3_COMBAT_1_4"
msgstr "While you are <bgc>FILTHY</> you won’t be able to clean. Plus if the room you are in is <bgc>not fully cleaned</> you’ll leave a trail of filth everywhere you go. Wouldn’t wanna help our unwanted invaders, right?"

#. Key:	TUT_0_R3_COMBAT_1_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R3_COMBAT_1_5"
msgid "TUT_0_R3_COMBAT_1_5"
msgstr "Stop talking like that, I know what I am doing!"

#. Key:	TUT_0_R3_COMBAT_1_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R3_COMBAT_1_6"
msgid "TUT_0_R3_COMBAT_1_6"
msgstr "Our enemies are <b>far too weak to actually hurt you</>. So their attacks just get you <bgc>FILTHY</> instead. Keep an eye on your <bcc>HP</>, your Hygiene Points."

#. Key:	TUT_0_R3_COMBAT_1_7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R3_COMBAT_1_7"
msgid "TUT_0_R3_COMBAT_1_7"
msgstr "While you are <bgc>FILTHY</> you won’t be able to clean! Plus if the room you are in is <bgc>not fully cleaned</> you’ll leave a trail of filth everywhere you go. Wouldn’t wanna help our unwanted invaders, right?"

#. Key:	TUT_0_R3_COMBAT_1_8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R3_COMBAT_1_8"
msgid "TUT_0_R3_COMBAT_1_8"
msgstr "Stop talking like that, I know what I am doing!"

#. Key:	TUT_0_R3_FILTHY_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R3_FILTHY_1"
msgid "TUT_0_R3_FILTHY_1"
msgstr "There we go, mark of a good housemaid: Weapons primed and a spotless apron!"

#. Key:	TUT_0_R3_FILTHY_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R3_FILTHY_2"
msgid "TUT_0_R3_FILTHY_2"
msgstr "As you may have noticed, our enemies are <b>far too weak to actually hurt you</>. So their attacks just get you <bgc>FILTHY</> instead. So keep an eye on your <bcc>HP</>. Your Hygiene Points."

#. Key:	TUT_0_R3_FILTHY_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R3_FILTHY_3"
msgid "TUT_0_R3_FILTHY_3"
msgstr "<bcc>Clean-o-Matics</> clean you up nice and good, but they take time to recharge after each use. You can use them while they are not completely filled, but they'll heal you <b>less</>..."

#. Key:	TUT_0_R3_FILTHY_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R3_FILTHY_4"
msgid "TUT_0_R3_FILTHY_4"
msgstr "While you are <bgc>FILTHY</> you won’t be able to clean! Plus if the room you are in is <bgc>not fully cleaned</> you’ll leave a trail of filth everywhere you go. Wouldn’t wanna help our unwanted invaders, right?"

#. Key:	TUT_0_R3_FILTHY_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R3_FILTHY_5"
msgid "TUT_0_R3_FILTHY_5"
msgstr "I already knew that…"

#. Key:	TUT_0_R3_FILTHY_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_0_R3_FILTHY_6"
msgid "TUT_0_R3_FILTHY_6"
msgstr "Everyone needs a refresher from time to time! Now lets keep going, we still have <bgc>Oozers</> on the loose!"

#. Key:	TUT_1_BUFFFILTH_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_1_BUFFFILTH_1"
msgid "TUT_1_BUFFFILTH_1"
msgstr "<b>YIKES</>!! Look at this place! It’s revolting! And the <bgc>Oozers</>… They don’t look stronger, but they <c>definitely</> look much, much <bgc>tougher</>!"

#. Key:	TUT_1_BUFFFILTH_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_1_BUFFFILTH_2"
msgid "TUT_1_BUFFFILTH_2"
msgstr "Yes, when a room is <bgc>too filthy</>, our enemies get much harder to kill since <bgc>their bodies absorb more of my attacks</>."

#. Key:	TUT_1_BUFFFILTH_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_1_BUFFFILTH_3"
msgid "TUT_1_BUFFFILTH_3"
msgstr "So if we <bcc>clean</> enough, they’ll turn back into soft, squishy, wimpy little punching bags?"

#. Key:	TUT_1_BUFFFILTH_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_1_BUFFFILTH_4"
msgid "TUT_1_BUFFFILTH_4"
msgstr "That is good a way to put it."

#. Key:	TUT_1_BUFFFILTH_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_1_BUFFFILTH_5"
msgid "TUT_1_BUFFFILTH_5"
msgstr "Crystal clear! From now on, any room so filthy it actually <bgc>buffs</> our enemies will be marked <bgc>FULLY GREEN</> on the minimap."

#. Key:	TUT_1_BUFFFILTH_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_1_BUFFFILTH_6"
msgid "TUT_1_BUFFFILTH_6"
msgstr "Keep an eye out for these rooms. They’ll definitely take longer to deal with!"

#. Key:	TUT_1_BUFFFILTH_7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_1_BUFFFILTH_7"
msgid "TUT_1_BUFFFILTH_7"
msgstr "Keep an eye out for these rooms. They’ll definitely take longer to deal with!"

#. Key:	TUT_1_CRREWARDS_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_1_CRREWARDS_1"
msgid "TUT_1_CRREWARDS_1"
msgstr "I'm ready to go. Let's show these pests who's boss!"

#. Key:	TUT_1_CRREWARDS_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_1_CRREWARDS_2"
msgid "TUT_1_CRREWARDS_2"
msgstr "Splendid! Just a teeny, tiny refresher: Every time you clean a room to completion you will be gifted with some <bcc>extra time</>. But extra time isn’t the only thing you get!"

#. Key:	TUT_1_CRREWARDS_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_1_CRREWARDS_3"
msgid "TUT_1_CRREWARDS_3"
msgstr "Every room also throws in a little bonus!! For example: <bcc>Kitchens</> will give ya even <bcc>more time</>, and <bcc>Living Rooms</> will give you some free charge for your <bcc>SPECIAL ATTACK</>!"

#. Key:	TUT_1_CRREWARDS_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_1_CRREWARDS_4"
msgid "TUT_1_CRREWARDS_4"
msgstr "Other rooms will have different little rewards, all of that <c>on top</> of the bonus time. Pretty sweet deal, right? Keep an eye on the bottom right of your minimap, there you'll see the reward of the room you are in."

#. Key:	TUT_1_CRREWARDS_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_1_CRREWARDS_5"
msgid "TUT_1_CRREWARDS_5"
msgstr "Hm… that <c>is</> very useful. How do you manage to do that anyways?"

#. Key:	TUT_1_CRREWARDS_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_1_CRREWARDS_6"
msgid "TUT_1_CRREWARDS_6"
msgstr "That is a secret of the trade! Remind me to tell you when you retire. As I always say: <b>Keep your tricks in a basket, or someone else will snatch 'em!</>"

#. Key:	TUT_1_CRREWARDS_7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_1_CRREWARDS_7"
msgid "TUT_1_CRREWARDS_7"
msgstr "Hmmf…"

#. Key:	TUT_1_CRREWARDS_8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_1_CRREWARDS_8"
msgid "TUT_1_CRREWARDS_8"
msgstr "Hmmf…"

#. Key:	TUT_COMPLETE_ARSENAL_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_COMPLETE_ARSENAL_1"
msgid "TUT_COMPLETE_ARSENAL_1"
msgstr "The <bcc>Dirtminator?</>? What did you do to it?"

#. Key:	TUT_COMPLETE_ARSENAL_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_COMPLETE_ARSENAL_2"
msgid "TUT_COMPLETE_ARSENAL_2"
msgstr "Just removed the muffler, tightened some screws, changed the <bcc>black hole engine</>, and gave it a fresh coat of paint! Barely had to tweak it!"

#. Key:	TUT_COMPLETE_ARSENAL_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_COMPLETE_ARSENAL_3"
msgid "TUT_COMPLETE_ARSENAL_3"
msgstr "This baby doesn’t just clean dust anymore. It inhales filth, exhales destruction, and completely <b>voids</> its warranty every single time you pull the trigger! Like any good felony!"

#. Key:	TUT_COMPLETE_ARSENAL_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_COMPLETE_ARSENAL_4"
msgid "TUT_COMPLETE_ARSENAL_4"
msgstr "As long as it works, I don’t care about warranties."

#. Key:	TUT_COMPLETE_ARSENAL_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_COMPLETE_ARSENAL_5"
msgid "TUT_COMPLETE_ARSENAL_5"
msgstr "Atta maid! That’s the spirit! I’ll leave it in your <bcc>WEAPONS CHEST</> for you to pick as you do with any of your weapons."

#. Key:	TUT_COMPLETE_ARSENAL_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_COMPLETE_ARSENAL_6"
msgid "TUT_COMPLETE_ARSENAL_6"
msgstr "This bad boy will replace <bcc>Dusty</> in your fight against, well… <bgc>dust</>! If you decide to take it with you that is."

#. Key:	TUT_COMPLETE_ARSENAL_7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_COMPLETE_ARSENAL_7"
msgid "TUT_COMPLETE_ARSENAL_7"
msgstr "Very well. With the <bcc>Dirtminator</> back in my hands my arsenal is complete."

#. Key:	TUT_EXPO_CHEST_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_EXPO_CHEST_1"
msgid "TUT_EXPO_CHEST_1"
msgstr "Wait, <b>you</> had <b>this</> all along? I’ve been looking around for it for days!"

#. Key:	TUT_EXPO_CHEST_10
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_EXPO_CHEST_10"
msgid "TUT_EXPO_CHEST_10"
msgstr "Now this is why we make such a good team. We are great at exposition for the gamers!"

#. Key:	TUT_EXPO_CHEST_11
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_EXPO_CHEST_11"
msgid "TUT_EXPO_CHEST_11"
msgstr "The wh-"

#. Key:	TUT_EXPO_CHEST_12
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_EXPO_CHEST_12"
msgid "TUT_EXPO_CHEST_12"
msgstr "<bst>Now onwards!</>"

#. Key:	TUT_EXPO_CHEST_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_EXPO_CHEST_2"
msgid "TUT_EXPO_CHEST_2"
msgstr "Sorry! Didn’t think you’d need it again for a while! Was thinking of giving it back with a detachable handle so you could have some nice add-ons on it…"

#. Key:	TUT_EXPO_CHEST_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_EXPO_CHEST_3"
msgid "TUT_EXPO_CHEST_3"
msgstr "Shame the <bcc>development team</> ran out of time…"

#. Key:	TUT_EXPO_CHEST_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_EXPO_CHEST_4"
msgid "TUT_EXPO_CHEST_4"
msgstr "Development… team...?"

#. Key:	TUT_EXPO_CHEST_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_EXPO_CHEST_5"
msgid "TUT_EXPO_CHEST_5"
msgstr "Nevermind that! You see <bgc>Ooze</> isn’t the only type of filth you have to deal with. <bgc>Dust</> is also an issue!"

#. Key:	TUT_EXPO_CHEST_6
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_EXPO_CHEST_6"
msgid "TUT_EXPO_CHEST_6"
msgstr "It's wise to take a weapon to deal with it, since you know… <bcc>Washee and Flashee</> can’t deal with it at all!"

#. Key:	TUT_EXPO_CHEST_7
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_EXPO_CHEST_7"
msgid "TUT_EXPO_CHEST_7"
msgstr "Likewise, <bcc>Dusty</> here will be useless against <bgc>ooze</>. I must use the right tool for the right obstacle."

#. Key:	TUT_EXPO_CHEST_8
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_EXPO_CHEST_8"
msgid "TUT_EXPO_CHEST_8"
msgstr "Exactly! Each weapon deals with a specific type of filth, and each has its own <bcc>SPECIAL ATTACK</> bar that fills up separately from the other. Also, <b>the controls remain the same</>. Elegant and conveniently ergonomic, right?"

#. Key:	TUT_EXPO_CHEST_9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_EXPO_CHEST_9"
msgid "TUT_EXPO_CHEST_9"
msgstr "Here in your <bcc>WEAPONS CHEST</> you can check your weapons at any time before you start your shift. See what they do and whatnot."

#. Key:	TUT_EXPO_WEAPONLIMIT_1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_EXPO_WEAPONLIMIT_1"
msgid "TUT_EXPO_WEAPONLIMIT_1"
msgstr "Oh ho ho ho! Now we are talking! We are bringing in the big guns now? Why haven't you taken the <bcc>Mopressor</> out for a spin lately?"

#. Key:	TUT_EXPO_WEAPONLIMIT_2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_EXPO_WEAPONLIMIT_2"
msgid "TUT_EXPO_WEAPONLIMIT_2"
msgstr "Just had to add a few special touches. Switched the old handle with one made of industrial-grade <bcc>cleanium</>, and weighted the head with ultra-dense <bcc>Armstrong Cleaning Gel™</>."

#. Key:	TUT_EXPO_WEAPONLIMIT_3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_EXPO_WEAPONLIMIT_3"
msgid "TUT_EXPO_WEAPONLIMIT_3"
msgstr "Now <b>that</> sounds incredibly reckless, irresponsible.. and fun! It is less of a cleaning accessory and closer to a war crime really... Are you sure you don't need a permit to own it?"

#. Key:	TUT_EXPO_WEAPONLIMIT_4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_EXPO_WEAPONLIMIT_4"
msgid "TUT_EXPO_WEAPONLIMIT_4"
msgstr "Yeah, yeah... The <bcc>Mopressor</> is quite useful. Shame I can’t bring both it and <bcc>Washee and Flashee</> out with me on the same day. I’ll have to <b>pick one or the other</> and roll with it."

#. Key:	TUT_EXPO_WEAPONLIMIT_5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
