#: /Game/Data/StringTables/ST_DIALOGS.ST_DIALOGS
msgctxt "ST_DIALOGS,TUT_EXPO_WORKSH_10"
msgid "TUT_EXPO_WORKSH_10"
msgstr "Use the <b>Left Joystick</> or use the <b>A</> and <b>D</> keys to scroll through the <bcc>WORKSHOP</>. When you see a gadget you like, press <b>ENTER</> key or the <b>A Button</> on your controller to equip them on the gadget slots seen bellow."

